Z||000009||AusFiero||12-17-2001||04:42 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierohoho:<BR><B>Just a stray thought, what color is her hair and what color is the car?<P>I'll guess blond and red.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>LOL<BR>I was thinking that too.<P>Here's an unlucky driver for you. A guy I used to know bought a new Holden in the 80s. On his way home from the dealers someone rear ended it. He got it back a few weeks later and again was hit by someone on the way home. So again he waited. Got it back and actually got to drive it for a whole week. Before being rear ended again. All these accidents not being his fault.<P>Anyway, then he got the car back and decided to go to the local hill climb (car racing) on the weekend and was having some fun on his way out to the track. Well he lost control and spun out into a paddock (field) and lo and behold, he hit the only tree for half a mile in either direction. He fixed and sold his demon car from hell.<P><P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/auschristmas.gif">        <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
